ASSERT ok   and the 405 on an unconfigured preflight is a property of not installing, not of the version
ASSERT ok   the preflight short-circuit is unchanged across the two versions
ASSERT ok   boot-time origin validation is unchanged across the two versions
ASSERT ok   every status code the probe observes is identical on 0.6.11 and 0.7.1, so the 0.6-to-0.7 move changes the Vary value and nothing else this item depends on

